    "body": "I am not sure there is a bug here. Decimal seems to imply the base, not that fractions are allowed (decimal vs hexadecimal, etc). \"Number\" is typically used to mean a whole number or one with a fractional part, \"integer\" typically means no fraction. For instance, see https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/number, but it is pretty common for number to mean whole or fractional.",
